OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThrough the
OL,6,Fevening and overnight it will remain
OL,7,Fcloudy across all parts with a few
OL,8,Flight outbreaks of rain and drizzle
OL,9,Fpossible, but predominantly dry.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FIt will be a dry day with
OL,12,Fbright and sunny spells developing
OL,13,Flater after a cloudy start.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,16,FMonday and Tuesday with variable cloud
OL,17,Finterspersed with bright and sunny
OL,18,Fspells. Bright spells and perhaps
OL,19,Fshowers on Wednesday. Overnight frost
OL,20,Fand fog possible under clearer skies.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
